# Vector-3D: a 3-component 32-bit-float vector. Pure float math, identical on every backend. `add` / `subtract` combine two, as they do two numbers (it wears `addition` and `subtraction`). `scale` multiplies by a scalar, `dot` is the scalar product, `cross` the vector product, `magnitude` the norm, `normalize` the unit vector, `distance` the gap between two points.

mark unstable

load @term/base/float
  find square-root

load @term/base/arithmetic
  find addition
  find subtraction

form vector-3
  link x, like float
  link y, like float
  link z, like float

  wear addition
    task add
      take self
      take other, like vector-3
      like vector-3
      send back
        make vector-3
          bind x
            call add
              read self/x
              read other/x
          bind y
            call add
              read self/y
              read other/y
          bind z
            call add
              read self/z
              read other/z

  wear subtraction
    task subtract
      take self
      take other, like vector-3
      like vector-3
      send back
        make vector-3
          bind x
            call subtract
              read self/x
              read other/x
          bind y
            call subtract
              read self/y
              read other/y
          bind z
            call subtract
              read self/z
              read other/z

  # the names before `add` reached a vector (note/term/plan/decisions-2026-10.md, D5), kept for one release
  task plus
    take self
    take other, like vector-3
    like vector-3
    mark deprecated
    back self/add(other)

  task minus
    take self
    take other, like vector-3
    like vector-3
    mark deprecated
    back self/subtract(other)

  task scale
    take self
    take factor, like float
    like vector-3
    send back
      make vector-3
        bind x
          call multiply
            read self/x
            read factor
        bind y
          call multiply
            read self/y
            read factor
        bind z
          call multiply
            read self/z
            read factor

  task dot
    take self
    take other, like vector-3
    like float
    send back
      call add
        call add
          call multiply
            read self/x
            read other/x
          call multiply
            read self/y
            read other/y
        call multiply
          read self/z
          read other/z

  task cross
    take self
    take other, like vector-3
    like vector-3
    send back
      make vector-3
        bind x
          call subtract
            call multiply
              read self/y
              read other/z
            call multiply
              read self/z
              read other/y
        bind y
          call subtract
            call multiply
              read self/z
              read other/x
            call multiply
              read self/x
              read other/z
        bind z
          call subtract
            call multiply
              read self/x
              read other/y
            call multiply
              read self/y
              read other/x

  # the norm: `magnitude`, since a collection's `length` counts its items (note/term/plan/decisions-2026-10.md, D2)
  task magnitude
    take self
    like float
    send back
      call square-root
        call dot
          read self
          read self

  # the older name of `magnitude`, kept one release
  task length
    take self
    like float
    mark deprecated
    back magnitude(self)

  task normalize
    take self
    like vector-3
    save magnitude
      call magnitude
        read self
    send back
      make vector-3
        bind x
          call divide
            read self/x
            read magnitude
        bind y
          call divide
            read self/y
            read magnitude
        bind z
          call divide
            read self/z
            read magnitude

  task distance
    take self
    take other, like vector-3
    like float
    send back
      call magnitude
        call minus
          read self
          read other

task make-vector-3
  take x, like float
  take y, like float
  take z, like float
  like vector-3
  send back
    make vector-3
      bind x, read x
      bind y, read y
      bind z, read z
